39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Thank you,</span><u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><br></span>Milena<u></u><u></u></div></div></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">--<span> </span><br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to<span> </span><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-r-pack...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>To post to this group, send email to<span> </span><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>Visit this group at<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486186080000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3amsunViEqjBxWsYGsJjW_\">https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package</a>.<br>To view this discussion on the web, visit<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/892ee3d7-80f1-41da-b3a5-eacf28dae8ac%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package